  "changelog": [
    {
      "from": "0.1.0",
      "to": "0.2.0",
      "date": "2026-09-27",
      "change": "ADR-0018 freeze: preserve original semantic colors; add interaction, focus, diff backgrounds, overlay, density, motion, chart sequence and disabled-state tokens."
    },
    {
      "from": "0.2.0",
      "to": "0.2.1",
      "date": "2026-09-28",
      "change": "Close the frozen design-contract gap by adding the semantic 1px hairline border width already required by 03_DESIGN/03_VISUAL_SYSTEM.md and already used by the P0 UI. No color, spacing, radius, typography, layout, motion, shadow or status semantics change."
    },
    {
      "from": "0.2.1",
      "to": "0.3.0",
      "date": "2026-10-11",
      "change": "ADR-0031 lifts ADR-0018 D3's light-only rule for the Developer Preview. color.dark is added as a sibling of color.light carrying the same 30 role names, no more and no fewer; the generator emits both and measures WCAG 2.2 AA on 18 rendered pairs per theme, with one named exemption. No light value moves: light diff.removed on diff.removed.bg measures 4.4974:1, a hair under the floor, and the byte that would clear it is already printed into golden/reports/p2-diff.html and golden/reports/p4-release/release-report.html, so changing it here would move an exported artefact under a round that promised not to. The exemption is recorded in the generator and in ADR-0031 D6, not in a lowered floor. No spacing, radius, typography, layout, table, motion, focus, shadow or status-semantics value changes."
    },
    {
      "from": "0.3.0",
      "to": "0.4.0",
      "date": "2026-10-16",
      "change": "ADR-0034 (Instrument Ledger). Additive: typography.size.figure 28 / line_height.figure 36 for the one lead figure per page or report; typography.weight regular 400 / semibold 600 replacing the CSS bold keyword; layout.topbar 40, layout.subject_bar 44, layout.rail_collapsed 56; layout.breakpoint rail_collapse 1180 / inspector_dock 1280; icon.size sm 16 / md 20 and icon.stroke 1.5. One value moves: light diff.removed #C9372C -> #C7372C, 4.5592:1 on diff.removed.bg, which retires ADR-0031 D6's only contrast exemption; the two report goldens that print it are regenerated on purpose. No palette, spacing, radius, density, motion, focus or shadow value moves."
    }
  ]
